      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a bit vague lol. like, if someone makes a joke that relies on a stereotype about a specific religious or ethnic group to mock a politician, is the \"standard\" to leave it up as satire or take it down as hate speech? i need to know which way the wind is blowing so we don't get buried in PR issues or lawsuits.",
